{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43194","headline":"采莲 · 徐玄之","name":"采莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越艳荆姝惯采莲，兰桡画檝满长川。\n秋来江水澄如练，映水红妆如可见。\n此时莲浦珠翠光，此日荷风罗绮香。\n纤手周游不暂息，红英烂熳殊未极。\n夕鸟栖林人欲稀，长歌哀怨采莲归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐玄之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}